  instructions:"Combine cognac, crème de cacao, and cream in a shaker with ice. Shake hard for 20 seconds. Strain into a chilled coupe. Grate fresh nutmeg over the top.",
  notes:"Fresh nutmeg grated over the top is essential — pre-ground nutmeg is a poor substitute. Use dark crème de cacao for a richer chocolate flavor. This is a dessert cocktail — rich, sweet, and deeply satisfying.",
