  notes:"Fresh nutmeg on the garnish is non-negotiable — pre-ground does not have the same aromatic impact. Ruby port is the classic choice; tawny port gives a nuttier, more oxidized character. Dry shake first, then shake with ice — this sequence produces a much better foam than shaking with ice from the start.",
