  notes:"The Americano is the ancestor of the Negroni — substitute gin for the soda water and you have one. Lower-ABV, endlessly refreshing, and the perfect introduction to the bitter aperitivo style. James Bond orders one in the first chapter of Casino Royale — his very first drink in the entire canon.",
