  notes:"Cherry Heering specifically — not generic cherry brandy. The Bénédictine is the secret weapon and should not be omitted. Raffles Hotel's reconstructed spec uses Tanqueray gin as the base. The grenadine and pineapple juice quantities in widely circulated recipes are frequently wrong — err toward less grenadine and more pineapple.",
