  notes:"The ✨ next to the syrup means the recipe lives in the Craft section. Fresh grapefruit is preferred — yellow, pink, or red all work, each with a slightly different profile. The rosemary syrup is doing specific structural work here: it tempers the tartness and adds a savory piney backbone that makes the drink feel like more than juice with bubbles. ATK's headnote gives you the spirit path: add 1 oz of blanco tequila, vodka, or London dry gin to turn it into a proper spritz.",
