          tags:["House Made"],
          yield:"4 oz",
          description:"A warm, floral, and faintly citrusy extract that adds aromatic depth to cocktails in a single drop. Use whole green cardamom pods, lightly crushed, not ground. The pods woody structure slows extraction just enough to capture the bright, aromatic top notes without pulling harsh bitterness from the seeds. Pre-ground cardamom will give you silt and disappointment in equal measure.",
