          tags:[],
          description:"Two strips of citrus peel shaped into a mermaid tail — one of Reid Nelson most shared garnishes, with over 145,000 likes on Instagram. Placed on the rim or floating on a foam surface, it is immediately recognizable and completely unexpected on a cocktail glass. The technique takes about three minutes once you have the basic peel-cutting skill.",
